OL,3,GNEWSACollege closed after shots fired
OL,4,Ato reopen
OL,5,
OL,6,FA sixth form college which closed for
OL,7,Fthe day after gunmen fired shots at a
OL,8,Fnearby house has confirmed it will
OL,9,F"reopen as normal" on Thursday.
OL,11,FSouth Yorkshire Police said officers
OL,12,Fwere called to reports of a firearm
OL,13,Fbeing discharged outside a property in
OL,14,FHorninglow Road, in Sheffield, at about
OL,15,F04.42 BST, near to Longley Park Sixth
OL,16,FForm Academy.
OL,18,FThe force said it happened shortly
OL,19,Fafter a similar attack on a property in
OL,20,FSwanbourne Road. Nobody was hurt in
OL,21,Feither incident.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
