OL,3,GNEWSACollege closed after shots fired
OL,4,Ato reopen
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe college, which said it was "not in
OL,7,Fany way connected" to the shooting in
OL,8,FHorninglow Road, added "all students
OL,9,Fshould attend as usual" on Thursday.
